title: The file tabs and the one in front are kept with the session: started again, the three tabs are there with the second in front
folders: rust-small
limit: 70
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: tabs: \[.*main\.rs, .*util\.rs, .*steps\.rs\], in front: Some\(1\)
again-forbid-log: script: ignoring
again-expect-log: tabs: \[.*main\.rs, .*util\.rs, .*steps\.rs\], in front: Some\(1\)
again-expect-log: tabs: \[.*main\.rs, .*util\.rs, .*steps\.rs\], in front: None

wait 3000
tab open src/main.rs
wait 600
tab open src/util.rs
wait 600
tab open src/steps.rs
wait 600
tab front 2
wait 1000
mark before-quit
wait 450
tab report
quit

=== again
wait 4000
mark after-restart
wait 600
tab report
tab canvas
wait 800
mark canvas
wait 450
tab report
quit
